\newlabel{tbl:pipeline_steps}{{1}{13}{The pipeline steps with the thin orchestrator module that owns each and the one-line purpose parsed from the master table in \protect \breaktt {src/gnn/STEP\_INDEX.md}. Read the Step column against the arrows of fig.~\ref {fig:pipeline}: each row's purpose is the transformation that module owns, and the table is regenerated from the index at every build, so it cannot drift from the code it describes}{tbl:pipeline_steps}{}}
